{"key": "eval12:eval12@01cfbb1e713f-1c7e18597b|explicit", "final": "WITH s1 AS (SELECT observstation AS o, COUNT(*) AS c FROM telescopes GROUP BY observstation), s2 AS (SELECT SUM(c) AS t FROM s1), s3 AS (SELECT s1.o AS o, s1.c AS c, CAST(s1.c AS REAL) / NULLIF(s2.t, 0) AS r FROM s1 JOIN s2 ON s2.t IS NOT NULL), s4 AS (SELECT AVG(r) AS a FROM s3) SELECT s3.o, s3.c, s3.r, s3.r - s4.a AS diff FROM s3 JOIN s4 ON s4.a IS NOT NULL WHERE s3.r > s4.a ORDER BY diff DESC LIMIT 10", "turns": 1, "batch_size": 1, "model": "sonnet", "executes": true, "answer": [["Observatory-East Michael                                    ", 3, 0.003161222339304531, 0.002068326164441155], ["Observatory-New Michael                                     ", 3, 0.003161222339304531, 0.002068326164441155], ["Observatory-East Brett                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-East Jeffrey                                    ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-East Kevin                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-East Samantha                                   ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-Jamesberg                                       ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-Juanville                                       ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-Lake David                                      ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774], ["Observatory-Lake Josephview                                 ", 2, 0.002107481559536354, 0.0010145853846729774]], "rows_answer": 10}